## 6. Recommended CI/CD Pipeline Order

For a reliable CI/CD workflow, the stages should follow this order:

1. Git Checkout
2. Compile
3. Test
4. Trivy Filesystem Scan
5. SonarQube Analysis
6. Quality Gate
7. Deploy to Nexus
8. Build and Tag Docker Image
9. Trivy Docker Image Scan
10. Push Docker Image to Docker Hub
11. Deploy to Kubernetes
12. Verify Kubernetes Deployment
13. Send Email Notification

**Important:** Kubernetes deployment should happen after the new Docker image has been built, scanned, and pushed. Otherwise, Kubernetes may deploy an older image.

