## Conclusion

During this project, I learned how to troubleshoot Jenkins plugin errors, Maven authentication problems, Nexus deployment failures, SonarQube webhook connectivity, Trivy scanning timeouts, Docker Hub authentication, Kubernetes image pulling, Pod management, port forwarding, Prometheus installation, and YAML configuration.

The most important lesson is to identify the root cause before changing configurations. I should use Jenkins Console Output, Kubernetes Events, Docker logs, and Prometheus configuration validation to troubleshoot problems systematically instead of randomly changing commands or settings.

